WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
Sorry, Minister, no qualified person was found.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,600
I guess this person’s name is not Jiaxin

3
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:07,400
When the female player heard me calling her Jiaxin, she turned around

4
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:10,000
This name should be familiar to her

5
00:00:10,350 --> 00:00:12,750
Forget it, let's put this matter aside for now

6
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:15,550
Minister, there are only nine samurai alive this time.

7
00:00:15,550 --> 00:00:17,750
All five members of the second team were on fire, but two were seriously injured.

8
00:00:17,750 --> 00:00:19,150
Being saved by healing tools

9
00:00:19,150 --> 00:00:22,150
With all of them being old players, only nine people survived.

10
00:00:22,150 --> 00:00:25,570
According to the plan, we tried to use the elevator to go to the fourth floor

11
00:00:25,570 --> 00:00:28,570
But the button on the fourth floor sent us to the eighth floor where the BOSS is.

12
00:00:28,770 --> 00:00:31,570
Passing the button on the fourth floor of the elevator will trigger a strange attack on the floor.

13
00:00:31,570 --> 00:00:34,170
The BOSS didn't show up. The one who took action was Secretary-General Ying Zhe.

14
00:00:34,170 --> 00:00:36,170
His ability is to shuttle between all reflective objects

15
00:00:36,170 --> 00:00:37,570
Hidden inside, immune to physical damage

16
00:00:37,570 --> 00:00:40,170
Then we tried the stairs, just like the minister said

17
00:00:40,170 --> 00:00:41,370
Extremely difficult to break through

18
00:00:41,370 --> 00:00:44,370
Finally, according to the third plan, we went to the fourth floor through the ventilation duct.

19
00:00:44,370 --> 00:00:46,970
On the fourth floor, there is a strange Ah Piao type that ignores physical attacks.

20
00:00:46,970 --> 00:00:48,970
Touching it will make you lose mobility immediately

21
00:00:48,970 --> 00:00:50,170
Fortunately, props can be controlled
